  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんじゃ、どっちでも
いいと言うとったくせに
取ってきたのか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this? You said you
don't care either way, but
here you are with the soil?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当は
興味津々なんじゃな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Truth is, you're mighty
interested, aren't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……このじじぃは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Seriously, this old man...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よかろう、約束じゃ、
聞かせてやろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Very well. It was a
promise, so I'll tell you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どっちでもいいけど、
聞いてやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't care either way,
but sure, I'll listen.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは多元宇宙の可能性を
模索する、その実験なんじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's for an experiment investigating
the possibilites of the multiverse.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たげん、うちゅう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mulltee...vurss?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>左様。この宇宙とは違う
もうひとつの宇宙を作る</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Indeed. I'll create another
universe, different from
this one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この人形は
その世界の監視者となる
存在なのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This doll will observe
that world for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よくわかんね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't get it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それってつまり
このアセリアみたいな星を
他にも作るってこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In short, you're going
to make another
planet like Aselia?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーむ、少し違うが、
それに近いかの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Well, not quite,
but that's close enough.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことして
どうするんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But what are you
doing that for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>様々な世界の可能性を
探るんじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll investigate many different
kinds of worlds.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の在り様は、わずかな
元素構成によって大きく
変化するのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even a small change in the
elements leads to a very
different kind of world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>地よりも水の精霊の力が強いと
それだけでそこに住む生物の形
がまったく違ってきおる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If the water spirit's power is greater than
the earth spirit's, the things living in that
world will take on whole other forms.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どの構成要素が優秀な生物を
作るのに最も最適か、それを
探るのが、この実験なのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This experiment will investigate what
balance of elements leads to the
most extraordinary living things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、これで監視者も
作ることができるかの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, this should be
enough for an observer.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、これはお礼じゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, right, take
this as thanks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>後は名前、と……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now for a name...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マクスウェル子で
いいんじゃねの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about Maxwella?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>勝手に、それも適当に
決めるんじゃない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't just go and
pick a name at random!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかも、なんで勝手に
女性にしとるんじゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And also, why've you
made it a woman?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや……でも、それも
よいかもの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Actually, that might be
a decent enough idea...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マクスウェル子が！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're really going
with Maxwella!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>違う！　監視者を
女性にするという
話のことじゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No! I meant making
the observer a woman!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うむ……そうしよう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... I'll do that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>で、名前は……
ブツブツブツ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, for the name...
*mumble* *mumble*</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……お邪魔みたいだから、
ぼくたち、もう行こうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I think we're just in the
way here, so let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……水が落ちる音……
孤独の音じゃの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Falling water... All the way down
here... Water's persistent... And powerful
enough to turn a waterwheel, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうじゃ……
水が落ちる……
水落なんて名はどうじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not bad... A strong current...
A mill... How about naming her...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんじゃ、
行ってしもうたのか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this?
They already left...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
